The '''Chicken N Egg Timecharm''' is a {{Special}} [[Rift Timecharms|Rift Timecharm]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Recipe Table
|{{Crafting Recipe Row
 |A1 = Caducous Stem Bunch   |B1 = Metaphoric Egg, 2 |C1 = Agaricus Cap Bunch
 |A2 = Metaphoric Egg, 2     |B2 = Proto-Chicken     |C2 = Metaphoric Egg, 2
 |A3 = Wilted Berberis Bunch |B3 = Metaphoric Egg, 2 |C3 = Wilted Berberis Bunch
 |Output = Chicken N Egg Timecharm
 }}
}}

== Usage ==
The player can secure the '''Chicken N Egg Timecharm''' in the {{zone|Rift Gallery}} to gain {{SkyBlock XP|+100}}, and along with the {{Item|mrahcemiT esrevrorriM}}, to unlock access to the {{zone|Village Plaza}} and thus all of the following locations:

*{{zone|Barry Center}}
*{{zone|Barry HQ}}
*{{zone|Empty Bank}}
*{{zone|Book in a Book}}
*{{zone|Déjà Vu Alley}}
*{{zone|Half-Eaten Cave}}
*{{zone|Lonely Terrace}}
*{{zone|Murder House}}
*{{zone|Taylor's}}
*{{zone|"Your" Island}}

=== Game Message ===
Securing the '''Chicken N Egg Timecharm''' will result in the following message, which will be broadcast to the entire lobby:
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|&d&lRIFTASTIC! &7[player] &ehas secured &cChicken N Egg Timecharm&e into their gallery! &6gg&e!}}}}
=== Rift Necklace ===
{{Main|Rift Necklace}}
Securing the '''Chicken N Egg Timecharm''' will add additional [[stats]] to the [[Rift Necklace]] both inside and outside the [[Rift Dimension]].

